## On trigger

- `auth_rules.md`: guard, restricted route, session, or redirect.
- `ui_rules.md`: flow across screens, dialog, or overlay.
- `error_handling_rules.md`: navigation failure or error flow.

Load every triggered rule before the first edit, in batches of up to two.

